The battle of Iwo Jima seen through the eyes of the Japanese soldiers.

2
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Letters from Iwo Jima is a action, drama, war film directed by Clint Eastwood.

3
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:15,000
The story of the battle of Iwo Jima between the United States and Imperial Japan during
World War II, as told from the perspective of the Japanese who fought it.

4
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:18,000
General Tadamichi Kuribayashi, played by Ken Watanabe.

5
